@startuml
title SIC/XE Simulator - Backend Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Server {
    +setup_http()
    +setup_ws()
}

class Simulator {
    +step()
    +run()
    +stop()
    +reset()
    +unstep()
    +break_on(address)
}

class ArchitectureManager {
    +list()
    +load(name)
    +unload()
}

class LoadedArchitecture {
    +info()
    +state()
    +reset()
    +step()
}

class SharedLoader {
    +load(path)
    +unload()
    +get(symbol)
}

class Registers {
    +allocate(id, name, initial_value)
    +deallocate(name)
    +get(name)
    +get_name(id)
}

class Memory {
    +read(address)
    +write(address, value)
}

class Project {
    +id
    +name
    +architecture
    +files
}

class ExecutionEvent {
    +type
    +payload
}

class ExecutionEventQueue {
    +push(event)
    +pop()
    +clear()
}

Server --> Simulator : dispatches commands
Simulator --> Project : current context
Simulator --> ArchitectureManager : selects architecture
ArchitectureManager --> LoadedArchitecture : owns/uses
LoadedArchitecture *-- SharedLoader : owns
LoadedArchitecture --> Registers
LoadedArchitecture --> Memory

Simulator --> Registers
Simulator --> Memory
Simulator --> ExecutionEventQueue

ExecutionEventQueue o-- ExecutionEvent

note right of Simulator
Logical execution/session coordinator.
Responsibilities include project context,
execution control, breakpoints and history.
end note

note right of LoadedArchitecture
Runtime-loaded architecture boundary.
The exact ABI/function-pointer surface
is defined by the plugin API.
end note

@enduml
